 ## 2026-09-14T14:24:02-04:00 — Fable round-4 review: approve with changes (no blockers); Planner decision A9 (list of approved launcher digests; training-closure equality is the single-delta check); schedule
 - `param_efficiency_fable_code_round4_review.md`: 13 adversarial receipt cases and 10 ledger refusals verified before any directory exists; producer ties verified; numbers identical to `265dc83`; CPU subset 1 068 passed. Item 5: L_simple must be re-probed at the launch commit (`f7b10b5` or later) and the single `training_launcher` pin would refuse it → A9. Nits: one message for seven receipt causes; binding file name; inert test pre-seed.
 - **Schedule** — exp_04 eval chain ends ≈ 02:30 → re-queue the three refused runs (≈ 25 min) → Codex window (exp_05 round 5: A9 producer change + nits; exp_04 round-8 close-out incl. the descriptive-grid producer) with NO launches during it → commit → L_simple probe + `full` on GPU 0 (≈ 04:00 Sep 15 → ≈ 22:00 Sep 15) → exp_05 evaluations for S/M/L_simple on GPU 0 (≈ 6.5 h) → L_cylindrical (≈ 10:00 Sep 16) evaluations on GPU 1 → producers → results ≈ Sep 17. exp_04 producers/analysis run during Sep 15 from the completed chain.
+
